Proposed scope predicate:
```python
def proposed_scope_paths(root):
    paths = [root/"ledger/theorems.jsonl"] + sorted((root/"artifacts/literature/theorems").glob("batch-*.jsonl"))
    return paths
def proposed_check(root): 
    # fail closed: canonical must exist & parse
    out=[]; 
    for p in proposed_scope_paths(root):
        if not p.exists(): out.append((rel(p), "MISSING_CANONICAL")); continue
        for obj in iter_objects(p):
            if is_record(obj) and hf14_hit(obj): out.append((rel(p), where(obj)))
    return out
```
